  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -36,
        -30
      ],
      "id": 29,
      "text": "ATmega328P at the factory clock (1 MHz) with avr328_pwm: Timer0's fast PWM on OC0A (PD6, 25 %) and\nOC0B (PD5, inverting), Timer2's phase-correct PWM on OC2A (PB3) from the potentiometer and OC2B (PD3)\nopposite, Timer1's 50 Hz square wave on OC1A (PB1). The ADC converts on its own at each Timer0\noverflow (auto trigger). Drag RV1 while running: PB3's duty and the filtered voltage (R2, C1) follow."
    }
  ],
